---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Sidebar from '../components/Sidebar.astro';
import Icons from '../components/Icons.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Sick Industries Revival & Restructuring | OTS Advisory — Aakkam Corporate Solutions"
  description="Turnaround advisory for distressed businesses: One Time Settlement (OTS) negotiations, BIFR/IBC relief, loan restructuring, and operational revival packages."
>

  <!-- Clean Light Header with Krasis Orange Accents -->
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-b from-orange-50/60 via-white to-slate-50 border-b border-slate-200/80 py-12 sm:py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold tracking-wider uppercase bg-orange-100/80 text-brand-orange border border-orange-200 mb-4">
        Turnaround Advisory
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">
        Sick Industries Revival & Restructuring
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">
        Navigating debt distress, negotiating bank settlements (OTS), and engineering sustainable corporate turnarounds.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 sm:py-14">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-10 items-start">
      
      <main class="lg:col-span-8 bg-white p-6 sm:p-10 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/90 shadow-sm space-y-6">
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight pb-3 border-b border-slate-100">
          Sick Industries Revival & Restructuring
        </h2>

        <p class="text-base text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-left">
          We provide specialized advisory solutions to Sick Industries to help them tide over the bad times. Depending on the requirements of the firm, we negotiate on behalf of our clients with their Bankers for One Time Settlement (OTS), Restructuring or revival packages, and buying more time to comply with directives of the Banks. We also try to provide our clients with maximum relief against coercive action by regulatory bodies. We help Sick firms in raising fresh capital from Banks and chart out a fresh path for their revival.
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-4 pt-2">
          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-orange-50/40 border border-orange-100">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
              <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-orange-100 text-brand-orange flex items-center justify-center font-black text-sm">1</div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">Financial Restructuring</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed text-left">
              Fresh Investments are brought in the form of equity participation, loan, non-plan assistance or through the revival packages which involves write-off of past losses and infusion of fresh capital, etc. Measures such as waiver of loan/interest/ penal interest, conversion of loan into Equity, conversion of interest including penal interest into loan, moratorium on payment of loan/ Interest, Government guarantee, etc. are also taken to improve financial strength of the company.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
              <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-slate-200 text-slate-800 flex items-center justify-center font-black text-sm">2</div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">Business Restructuring</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed text-left">
              Change of management, organizational restructuring, hiving off viable units from corporate entities for formation of separate companies, closure of unviable units, formation of joint ventures by induction of partners capable of providing technical, financial and marketing inputs, change in product mix, improving marketing strategy, etc. may be involved depending on the need of the company.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-6 border-t border-slate-100 flex flex-wrap gap-4 items-center">
          <a
            href="/contact"
            class="inline-flex justify-center items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl text-sm font-bold text-white bg-brand-orange hover:bg-brand-orangeHover shadow-md shadow-orange-500/20 active:scale-[0.98] transition-all"
          >
            <span>Request Turnaround Consultation</span>
            <Icons name="chevron-right" class="w-4 h-4" />
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://wa.me/917010311971?text=Hello%20Aakkam%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20discuss%20sick%20industries%20revival%20and%20debt%20restructuring."
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex justify-center items-center gap-2 px-5 py-3.5 rounded-xl text-sm font-bold text-emerald-700 bg-emerald-50 hover:bg-emerald-100 border border-emerald-200 active:scale-[0.98] transition-all"
          >
            <Icons name="whatsapp" class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600" />
            <span>Chat on WhatsApp</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </main>

      <div class="lg:col-span-4">
        <Sidebar currentPath="/sick" />
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

</Layout>
